     reserve_monitoring: Monitor observed usage, remaining reserve and job liveness during admitted work. At reserve threat, stop new admission and reduce, checkpoint/stop or queue work within authority; record the trigger and outcome. Release grants only after the job and all its descendants stop, not merely when the launching agent returns.
     grant_recovery: On stale entries, allocator restart or requester crash, reconcile grants against identifiable live jobs and descendants before reclaiming capacity. Missing heartbeat alone is not proof of exit; retain uncertain reservations and queue until liveness is established or authorized containment stops the work. @reserve_monitoring
     bounded_calibration: When resource estimates are unknown, run one conservatively bounded representative instance, measure peaks and internal parallelism, and revise the request with margin before multiplying it. If a safe bound cannot be established, queue or report the missing capacity/control rather than fabricate an estimate. @absent
-    advisory_limits: Where coordinated admission or runtime controls are unavailable, state exactly which limits are advisory and restrict launch to a conservative bounded instance with calibration, monitoring and a stop/queue route; require coordinated admission before scaling. Do not label advisory caps enforced or compensate for missing controls by silently escaping them. @bounded_calibration @runtime_binding
+    advisory_limits: Where coordinated admission or runtime controls are unavailable, state exactly which limits are advisory. Before even the first advisory calibration or heavy launch, establish and record observable machine-wide exclusivity under one identifiable owner or an already-authorized exclusive-use mechanism; if exclusivity cannot be established, queue or report the coordination blocker and do not launch. A requester-local one-instance limit is insufficient. Under that exclusivity, restrict launch to one conservative bounded instance with calibration, monitoring and a stop/queue route; require coordinated admission before scaling. Do not label advisory caps enforced or compensate for missing controls by silently escaping them. @bounded_calibration @runtime_binding
